{
  "_comment": [
    "MCP 客户端配置模板。",
    "把 mcpServers 整块合并进你的客户端配置文件：",
    "  · DSH        : 见 DSH 文档的 MCP 配置位置",
    "  · Cursor     : ~/.cursor/mcp.json  或项目 .cursor/mcp.json",
    "  · Claude     : claude_desktop_config.json",
    "  · VS Code    : .vscode/mcp.json",
    "",
    "⚠️ 把 <项目绝对路径> 换成你本机的真实路径。",
    "⚠️ Windows 路径要用正斜杠或双反斜杠。"
  ],

  "mcpServers": {
    "learning-progress": {
      "command": "uv",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "--directory",
        "<项目绝对路径>/rag-git-mcp_work",
        "python",
        "mcp_server/server.py"
      ],
      "env": {
        "DEEPSEEK_API_KEY": "<你的密钥>",
        "HF_ENDPOINT": "https://hf-mirror.com"
      }
    }
  }
}
